{
  "_doc": "Garage parts. One part per slot can be installed. Effects modify the physics (see SledSpec.deriveParams): powerPct, topSpeedPct, tractivePct (clutch low-end pull), weightKg, trackLengthIn (+/-), lugHeightSet (in), studGrip (ice/crust grip added to the track), springPct, dampingPct, travelFront/travelRear (m added), roughAbsorb (0..1 less chatter on rough snow), skiWidthAdd (m), skiBitePct (ski lateral grip on hard snow), durabilityAdd, peakRpmAdd, maxRpmAdd. tier = minimum sled tier (and the sled's maxPartTier caps what it accepts). towing=1 lets the sled tow the trailer; hitchYawBonus damps the trailer's swing at the hitch (less swing-out and jackknifing).",
